# Free AI CV Maker — environment variables
#
# The app works fully WITHOUT any of these. AI features are disabled by default.
#
# Optional: URL of YOUR OWN server-side AI proxy (see README "Optional AI integration").
# Never put an AI provider API key here: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are embedded in the
# public JavaScript bundle. The proxy holds the key server-side.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AI_PROXY_URL=https://your-worker.example.workers.dev/ai
#
# Optional: public contact address shown in the site footer as "Contact: <address>"
# (a mailto link). Leave unset and the footer shows no contact line. This value is
# public by design: it is embedded in the HTML and JavaScript at build time.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=hello@your-domain.example
